{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478020/extras/79541673de45954b20f79fdf662c8c6e.poster.avif?t=1765191950\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478020/extras/79541673de45954b20f79fdf662c8c6e.webm?t=1765191950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478020/extras/79541673de45954b20f79fdf662c8c6e.mp4?t=1765191950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478020/extras/953b7695e6c3cd94c7dba553176f484d.avif?t=1765191950\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your peaceful and boring daily life as a freelance illustrator is suddenly turned upside down when your truant little sister decided to crash in your apartment to skip school. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She's a downer and the silent type. So, you decided to let her stay and take care of her for the time being instead of prying any further. And besides... this might be your chance to finally break through that cold exterior and get closer to her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478020/extras/2a1eb9a9d7c1730ee039b8026183be25.avif?t=1765191950\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be a good brother, and take care of your sister, all while balancing your job as a freelance illustrator. Manage your time wisely as you spend your time with her and work on the illustrations you were commissioned for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish different commissions and receive money to buy several reference books and some QoL improvements for your room to make your cohabitation life with your sister even better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your little sister is a downer girl who needs your attention and care. Teach her how to study, cook for her,  give her praise or head pats, and she will open up to you as you spend more time with her.<br><br>Playtime: 2-4 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478020/extras/52aee421d88ff5844fcbd2afed8bbde4.avif?t=1765191950\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478020/extras/e24da9b1d3c00924f1dc0d7485efd9ef.avif?t=1765191950\" width=616 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478020/extras/5d236914978d587fd3b045f5967985dc.avif?t=1765191950\" width=616 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478020/extras/45a733de7d5a693b25604f23e60f0275.avif?t=1765191950\" width=616 height=90 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Easy-to-Understand Simulation Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your time wisely between your job and spending time with your little sister. You can talk with her, teach her how to study, and even give her some encouragement.  However, don't forget to do your commissions for your job so you can buy things and increase both your and your sister's quality of life.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Three Different Difficulties</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your preferred difficulty between easy, normal, and hard. The higher the difficulty, the more careful you will have to be with how you manage your time, and the less forgiving both the game and your sister are for any mistakes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Beautiful Monochrome Graphics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience what it would be like to step right into the pages of a manga with stunning black-and-white hand drawn graphics that are sure to be an unforgettable experience.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Sudden Arrival","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3478020/bd84a9d6209ccb0f0e3d870e9b2930a1674bf074.jpg"},{"name":"Good with Money","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3478020/75f000bc6e2bfab6eb554ce6884403fafe74ccf3.jpg"},{"name":"Shopping Aficionado","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3478020/940679235424dbb40a76a1b82fd8c434a9b4c1d5.jpg"},{"name":"Dilligent Artist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3478020/0495ff44a9b717e362aaabf7956d80907821ff2d.jpg"},{"name":"Trustworthy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3478020/87bf02d7cb24a2804a088d1c6d307e31dbe07473.jpg"},{"name":"Affectionate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3478020/a9c0d44780780546cd8ed5a50655f73cdf968103.jpg"},{"name":"Doting Big Brother","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3478020/10963f2569a2fa49c6c8eb5e60b2a6b555cf76c3.jpg"},{"name":"Living Together","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3478020/e673aeede6c423dc85528f9cb7fcfdd96d539783.jpg"},{"name":"Moving Onwards","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3478020/cc87f4094cc8aac8d32b25808f8b29222c9d64df.jpg"}],"total":9},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3478020?t=1765191950","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478020/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765191950","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478020/3c511b3a09f5af116fd709ba88c4e50d9d4fdae7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765191950","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478020/3c511b3a09f5af116fd709ba88c4e50d9d4fdae7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765191950","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3656440,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478020/extras/79541673de45954b20f79fdf662c8c6e.poster.avif?t=1765191950\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478020/extras/79541673de45954b20f79fdf662c8c6e.webm?t=1765191950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478020/extras/79541673de45954b20f79fdf662c8c6e.mp4?t=1765191950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478020/extras/953b7695e6c3cd94c7dba553176f484d.avif?t=1765191950\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your peaceful and boring daily life as a freelance illustrator is suddenly turned upside down when your truant little sister decided to crash in your apartment to skip school. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She's a downer and the silent type. So, you decided to let her stay and take care of her for the time being instead of prying any further. And besides... this might be your chance to finally break through that cold exterior and get closer to her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478020/extras/2a1eb9a9d7c1730ee039b8026183be25.avif?t=1765191950\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be a good brother, and take care of your sister, all while balancing your job as a freelance illustrator. Manage your time wisely as you spend your time with her and work on the illustrations you were commissioned for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish different commissions and receive money to buy several reference books and some QoL improvements for your room to make your cohabitation life with your sister even better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your little sister is a downer girl who needs your attention and care. Teach her how to study, cook for her,  give her praise or head pats, and she will open up to you as you spend more time with her.<br><br>Playtime: 2-4 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478020/extras/52aee421d88ff5844fcbd2afed8bbde4.avif?t=1765191950\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478020/extras/e24da9b1d3c00924f1dc0d7485efd9ef.avif?t=1765191950\" width=616 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478020/extras/5d236914978d587fd3b045f5967985dc.avif?t=1765191950\" width=616 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478020/extras/45a733de7d5a693b25604f23e60f0275.avif?t=1765191950\" width=616 height=90 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Easy-to-Understand Simulation Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your time wisely between your job and spending time with your little sister. You can talk with her, teach her how to study, and even give her some encouragement.  However, don't forget to do your commissions for your job so you can buy things and increase both your and your sister's quality of life.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Three Different Difficulties</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your preferred difficulty between easy, normal, and hard. The higher the difficulty, the more careful you will have to be with how you manage your time, and the less forgiving both the game and your sister are for any mistakes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Beautiful Monochrome Graphics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience what it would be like to step right into the pages of a manga with stunning black-and-white hand drawn graphics that are sure to be an unforgettable experience.</p>","developers":["Flash Club"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478020/header.jpg?t=1765191950","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"2025 Saikey Studios","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3478020/844178/a5513f4d24aef26e6a9a0d4ed86eb76d8d3378d6/1750826264/dash_av1.mpd?t=1743730457","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3478020/844178/a5513f4d24aef26e6a9a0d4ed86eb76d8d3378d6/1750826264/dash_h264.mpd?t=1743730457","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3478